{"sections":[{"slug":"Hopf代数","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Hopf代数"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Hopf <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Hopf 代数"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p>Hopf <span lang=\"zh\">代数可视为群的推广</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">它具有</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/双代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">双代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">结构与一个对径映射</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对径映射可视为群中取逆运算的推广</span>.</p>\n<p>Hopf <span lang=\"zh\">代数上的模范畴是群表示范畴的推广</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">另见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/量子群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">量子群</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">另见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/交换Hopf代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">交换</span> Hopf <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">传统定义</span></h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中的</span> Hopf <span lang=\"zh\">代数是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/双代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">双代数</span>"}},{"Plain":" $(A,m,\\eta,\\epsilon,\\Delta)$ <span lang=\"zh\">带有对径映射</span> $S\\colon A\\to A$, <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span>\n$$\r\nm (\\mathrm{id} \\otimes S) \\Delta = m (S \\otimes \\mathrm{id}) \\Delta = \\eta\\epsilon,\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">若</span> Hopf <span lang=\"zh\">代数满足</span> $S^2=\\mathrm{id}$, <span lang=\"zh\">则称之为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">对合</span> Hopf <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span></strong> (involutive Hopf algebra). <span lang=\"zh\">有时我们默认这个条件成立</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p>Hopf <span lang=\"zh\">代数的对偶也是</span> Hopf <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">群代数</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于交换环</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">与群</span> $G$, <span lang=\"zh\">群代数</span> $k[G]$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> Hopf <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">其对偶为群</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $k$-<span lang=\"zh\">值函数空间</span> $\\operatorname{Hom}(k[G],k)$ <span lang=\"zh\">在卷积下构成的代数</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">类似地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对于有限型代数群</span> $G$, <span lang=\"zh\">其上</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/D-模","text":"D-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的范畴</span> $D\\text{-}\\mathsf{Mod}(G)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/微分分次范畴","text":"$\\mathsf{DGCat}$"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span> Hopf <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">泛包络代数</span></h3>\n<p>Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span> $\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/泛包络代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">泛包络代数</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal U\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> Hopf <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">余乘法</span> $\\Delta\\colon \\mathcal U\\mathfrak g\\to\\mathcal U\\mathfrak g\\otimes\\mathcal U\\mathfrak g\\simeq\\mathcal U(\\mathfrak g\\times\\mathfrak g)$ <span lang=\"zh\">由对角映射</span> $\\mathfrak g\\to\\mathfrak g\\times\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">诱导</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其在</span> $X\\in\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的作用为</span> $\\Delta(X)= X\\otimes 1+1\\otimes X$.</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">对极映射</span> $S\\colon \\mathcal U\\mathfrak g\\to\\mathcal U\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">由</span> $-\\mathrm{id}\\colon \\mathfrak g\\to\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">诱导</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/仿射代数群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">仿射代数群</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Cartier对偶","text":"Cartier <span lang=\"zh\">对偶</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拟三角Hopf代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拟三角</span> Hopf <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/交换Hopf代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">交换</span> Hopf <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}